{"op":"add","path":"/elements/verdict-aero","value":{"type":"Card","props":{"title":"Aero 14 for travel","description":"Best balance of screen, weight and battery"},"children":["verdict-aero-text"]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/verdict-aero-text","value":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"The OLED panel and 1.2 kg frame make it the most pleasant to carry and work on all day. It costs $300 more than the Nimbus 13, and the RAM is soldered, so buy the memory you need up front.","variant":"body"},"children":[]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/verdict-forge","value":{"type":"Card","props":{"title":"Forge 16 for heavy workloads","description":"Most power, storage and ports"},"children":["verdict-forge-text"]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/verdict-forge-text","value":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"The 16-core CPU, 32 GB of RAM and 1 TB SSD lead the group, and RAM and storage can be upgraded later. The trade-offs are 9 hours of battery, a 2.1 kg body and audible fans. It costs $900 more than the Nimbus 13.","variant":"body"},"children":[]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/verdict-nimbus","value":{"type":"Card","props":{"title":"Nimbus 13 for value","description":"Longest battery and lowest price"},"children":["verdict-nimbus-text"]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/verdict-nimbus-text","value":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"At 1.0 kg with 22 hours of battery and the lowest price, it suits students and light office work best. The compromises are a dimmer IPS screen and a 256 GB SSD, so plan on external storage.","variant":"body"},"children":[]}}
{"op":"add","path":"/elements/footnote","value":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Price per GB is the list price divided by installed RAM or storage. Battery per kg is battery hours divided by weight.","variant":"small"},"children":[]}}
